{
  "name": "Findings & Red Flags",
  "description": "What diligence has found — each finding states the claim that was tested, what the evidence actually shows, and what it should do to valuation or terms. No finding exists without the evidence behind it.",
  "position": 3,
  "agentPrompts": [
    {
      "key": "cross-check-claims",
      "label": "Cross-check management's claims",
      "body": "Read the `busa-pe-diligence` skill in this folder and follow its workflow, then cross-check management's claims against the evidence for the target I name, and raise a flag wherever they disagree: state the claim, what the evidence shows, a severity from the skill's rubric, and the impact on valuation or terms. Every flag must link the evidence behind it — if there is no evidence, log it as an unverified claim instead of a finding."
    },
    {
      "key": "red-flag-brief",
      "label": "Brief me on the red flags",
      "intent": "read-only",
      "body": "Read the `busa-pe-diligence` skill in this folder and follow its workflow, then brief me on the open findings for the target I name, worst first: severity, what the evidence shows, and what each one should do to valuation or deal terms. Do not change anything."
    },
    {
      "key": "deal-breaker-check",
      "label": "Is there a deal-breaker here?",
      "intent": "read-only",
      "body": "Read the `busa-pe-diligence` skill in this folder and follow its workflow, then tell me whether anything found so far on the target I name meets the skill's deal-breaker bar, and what evidence would have to change for that verdict to move. Do not change anything."
    }
  ],
